Z||000007||Archie||07-06-2001||05:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierojunky:<BR><B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.org/pix/engine15.gif" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.org/pix/engine15.gif</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Memories, Oh Memories.<P>That picture was taken Aug. 1991 at IRP in Indianapolis. It was a Big Block brought to the show by Gary Zumwalt. Looked pretty impressive for the show but it was trailered in and we watched Gary push it off and back on the trailer. Don't know if it ran or not but he never started it at all before, during or after the show. I have some pics. someplace of him trying to push it onto the trailer by himself. He was towing the trailer with a old gold Old's 88 4 door. <P>The long weekend consisted of the Kit Car Magazine "Run & Gun" event on Wed, Thurs & Friday then the Kit Car show put on by SVCA Saturday & Sunday. Gary made it for the show but didn't bother to compete in the "Run & Gun". <P>Man 10 years ago, seems like yesterday.<P>Archie||||reg||1
